opticsIMRfcohHistoryDataTable OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF OpticsIMRfcohHistoryDataEntry
       MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
            "This table contains the History data for the RFCOH PM. "
::= { opticsIMRadioPmMibObject 6 }

opticsIMRfcohHistoryDataEntry OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX OpticsIMRfcohHistoryDataEntry
       MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
           "One entry of this table is created at the end of the time interval of the related CD (defined by 
            granularity Period).
            At most n entries of opticsIMRfcohHistoryDataTable can be created indexed by the indexes of the 
            corresponding CD entry and by the time of the measure (pmRfcohHDPeriodEndTime). 
            This set of n entries is wrapped, when the n+1 measure is provided. 
            The n+1 measure is written in the row of the table indexed by the smallest value of 
             PeriodEndTime. "
       INDEX       { ifIndex, pmRfcohCDIndex, pmRfcohHDPeriodEndTime }
::= { opticsIMRfcohHistoryDataTable 1 }

OpticsIMRfcohHistoryDataEntry ::= SEQUENCE {
   pmRfcohHDElapsedTime            OpticsIMPmElapsedTime,
   pmRfcohHDGranularityPeriod     OpticsIMPmGranularityPeriod, 
   pmRfcohHDNumSuppressedIntervals OpticsIMPmNumSuppressedIntervals, 
   pmRfcohHDPeriodEndTime                OpticsIMPmPeriodTime,
   pmRfcohHDSuspectIntervalFlag         OpticsIMPmSuspectIntervalFlag,
   pmRfcohHDStartByOS      TsdimManagerType,
   pmRfcohHDSes                Gauge32,
   pmRfcohHDUas                Gauge32,
   pmRfcohHDBbe                Gauge32,
   pmRfcohHDEs                  Gauge32,
   pmRfcohHDOfs                Gauge32
   }

