opticsIMRSLHopCurrentDataTable OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF OpticsIMRSLHopCurrentDataEntry
       MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
             " This table contains the current data for the Performance Monitoring of Receive Signal level at Radio 
               Hop level. "
