opticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataTable OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF OpticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataEntry
       MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
             " This table contains the current data for the Performance Monitoring of Receive Signal level at Radio 
               Link level. "
::= { opticsIMRadioPmMibObject 20 }

opticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataEntry OBJECT-TYPE
       SYNTAX OpticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataEntry
       MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
       STATUS current
       DESCRIPTION
            "An entry of the RSLDivLinkCurrentDataTable.
             An unavailable condition starts when 10 consecutive severely errored seconds have been 
            detected; these 10 seconds belong to the unavailable time. An unavailable condition 
            ends when 10 consecutive seconds with no severely errored second are detected. 
            These 10 seconds belong to  the available time.   
            If an unavailable period is ending then the UAT Clear shall be sent.
            These performance event counts are inhibited during unavailable time.

            In the objects where a Default Value is specified, the write operation is allowed only to the 
            indicated default value.
            The write operation to one counter is applied to all the counters of all the the associated objects, 
            which have a defined default."
       INDEX          {  ifIndex, pmRSLDivLinkCDIndex}
::= { opticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataTable 1 }   

OpticsIMRSLDivLinkCurrentDataEntry ::= SEQUENCE {
   pmRSLDivLinkCDIndex                                OpticsIMPmIndex,
   pmRSLDivLinkCDElapsedTime                          OpticsIMPmElapsedTime,
   pmRSLDivLinkCDGranularityPeriod                    OpticsIMPmGranularityPeriod, 
   pmRSLDivLinkCDMaxSuppressedIntervals               OpticsIMPmMaxSuppressedIntervals, 
   pmRSLDivLinkCDNumSuppressedIntervals               OpticsIMPmNumSuppressedIntervals,
